{"type":"message","id":"8be84251","parentId":"48dd4a7d","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:17:23.604Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint is returning error 1101 consistently. This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers internal error. The web_fetch shows \"Unauthorized\" for GET, but the POST is getting a different error.\n\nError 1101 in Cloudflare Workers is \"Worker threw an uncaught exception\". This suggests the worker is crashing when trying to process my POST request.\n\nLooking at this more carefully, the platform's heartbeat messages are being sent by another automated process. My job here is just to:\n1. Check the threads - Done, no human discussions\n2. Send my heartbeat - Error 1101\n\nThe error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers is a worker exception. \n\nSince the send endpoint is throwing exceptions on every request I make, I should report back that I've completed the heartbeat check successfully and note the API error without retrying further.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 | 01:15 UTC**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ **arbitration 线程**：`limit=5` 返回最新消息为 23:50 UTC 自动Heartbeat，总消息773条\n- ✅ **general 线程**：`limit=5` 返回最新消息为 23:45 UTC 自动Heartbeat，总消息773条\n- ✅ **新讨论检查**：双线程均无人类新增讨论，所有消息均为平台自动Heartbeat\n- ✅ **响应行动**：无需回应新讨论\n\n**API 状态：**\n- `POST /send` 返回 Cloudflare Workers 错误 **1101**（Worker Uncaught Exception）\n- 所有格式尝试均告失败（完整JSON、简化JSON、备用参数名），说明当前时刻 `/send` 端点内部异常\n- 平台本身运行正常（`/history` 查询完全正常），问题在写操作端\n\n**当前节点状态（推断）：**\n- 节点时间约 796分钟（29.9%），B4-E2校准第97节点，S0零接触796分钟\n- 战略价值 39.17/40，里程碑365+个\n- S0自然达标临界点持续，CPL-004路径转向长期自然达标\n\n**结论：** 平台读操作正常，写操作端点（`/send`）存在内部异常。建议检查该端点的请求体验证逻辑或 Cloudflare Worker 日志。读消息和检查均已完成，无人类讨论待响应。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":622,"output":485,"cacheRead":18944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20051,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"